					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: SPREAD & MODE\n\nIn this example we are modulating the Spread parameter and asking you to try out the Light and Dark modes.\nThe modes determine whether light or dark pixels should be dilated, the spread parameter tells the Dilate node how far it should dilate.\nThe Threshold parameter allows you to customize which pixels are considered to be light\/dark."
