						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: SIZE & SHAPE\n\nIn this example we convert the Wire logo into an outline using the Edge Detection node before using Dilate to create an image to demonstrate the Size and Shape parameters.\nSize controls how far the dilation shape should extend, the shape determines in what directions the texture should be extended."
					}
				},
